msgctxt "512"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Use the "
"<Action:Button_LS_Up@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Down@Cabaret><Action:Button_"
"LS_Left@Cabaret><Action:Button_LS_Right@Cabaret> to control your gaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> to stare at a particular area. Hold "
"down <Action:Button_Cross@Cabaret> to focus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Looking at different areas will provoke different reactions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "(Her calming eyes...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "(Her sweet lips...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "(Her dainty hands...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "(I can't see them because of her dress, but her legs...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "(Her hair...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "(Her chest...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "(Hmm...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Your eyes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "My eyes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "They're so calm and relaxed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Hey, don't stare right into them... You're going to make me\r\n"
"blush. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Your lips. They look so sweet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Hehe... Well, thank you. But there's nothing sweet about these lips! I'm "
"actually quite the potty mouth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Hehe... Yes, sometimes. I've stopped swearing so much since I moved to "
"Okinawa, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"The people of the island are so nice, I feel guilty being such a party "
"pooper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Makes sense to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I moved to Okinawa. I feel like I finally got back to being my "
"regular old self."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Your hands."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"I've got sakura on my nails today. I love them because they're just so pink "
"and cute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "I didn't know those were cherry blossoms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Yes! The sakura in Okinawa are different from those you might see on the "
"mainland. They even bloom at a different time, from January to February. "
"Did you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"The full name for them is <Italic>hikanzakura</Italic>. They're also known "
"as the bellflower cherry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Really? You learn something new every day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Most people assume that all sakura bloom in March or April, right? Not "
"here, though, hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Your legs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "What!? I don't think you've seen my legs, though, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Even tucked under your dress, I can tell they must be pretty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Aww... They're pretty beefy, though, thanks to all the bodyboarding I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "Hehe... I'll leave that up to your imagination. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "I like your hair. It's just the right style."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Hehe... So you like girls who put their hair up, huh, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"But you know, I've got to take it down when I'm out in the ocean, else I'll "
"never untangle it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "I wouldn't mind seeing what you look like with your hair down, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"Well, come out to the beach with me, and maybe you'll get a glimpse of it. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Your breasts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Oh, please... You're such a pervert, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Hey, now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"But you know, with all the bodyboarding I do, my chest has gotten pretty "
"buff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm.... But I'm not going to let you feel that for yourself. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Please, could you take this a little more seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Goodness... And here I thought I was still a looker..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "(Her eyes...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "(Her lips...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "(Her bracelet...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "(On her legs, maybe...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "(Is it the flower...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "(Is it the necklace...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "(What's the most Okinawan thing...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Is it your eyes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid "Really? Do you think my eyes have started to look more Okinawan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Yeah, definitely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1244"
msgid ""
"I guess you might be right... I feel like my eyes have taken on a little "
"bit more kinder look. At least, compared to when I lived in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"When I was working as a secretary out there, I had wrinkles on my forehead, "
"too. Really big ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid ""
"I'm so glad I moved to Okinawa. It was good for me in so many ways. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "Is it your lips?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid ""
"Hehe! That's right! The lipstick I'm wearing today... was made right here "
"in Okinawa! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "Oh, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"I only bought it because you never see locally-made beauty products around "
"here, and it's actually pretty great stuff! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid ""
"So great, actually, that I bought every single color in their\r\n"
"lineup! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Heh, don't go overboard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "Is it that bracelet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "That's not it, no. I bought this in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid ""
"It was something I got to treat myself after one particularly long day of "
"work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "What was the occasion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid ""
"The first assignment I was ever given! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I did a "
"really good job, so I decided to reward myself a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Oh... That sounds a bit sad, huh? A grown woman buying presents for herself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "There's nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid ""
"Hehe... good. It's always easier to give it your all if you know there's a "
"little reward waiting for you in the end. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "Is it on your legs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid ""
"That's not it. I'm not wearing anything particularly Okinawan on my legs "
"today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid ""
"Hehe, too bad. I do wear coral anklets from time to time, though, so good "
"guess!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "Is it that flower?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid ""
"Yup, that's right! It's my hibiscus flower. Was that too obvious? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "So... Do you know what the hibiscus flower represents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid "No, I don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "It represents a blossoming new romance... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid ""
"Maybe... it means there's something special blossoming between you and I, "
"Kiryu-san? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid "I hope so, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "Is it that necklace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid ""
"Yes, that's right! How did you know? The pearls on this necklace are all "
"from Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1616"
msgid ""
"Ise-Shima might be the first place you think of when it comes to high-grade "
"Japanese pearls, but Okinawa is pretty well-known for its pearls, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1628"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1640"
msgid ""
"Okinawan pearls are such a beautiful color... See? Isn't this pink just so "
"pretty?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1652"
msgid "Definitely, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1664"
msgid ""
"I like them so much, I even bought matching earrings! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1676"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1688"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid "Oh, no, just..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1712"
msgid "Honestly! Were you even listening to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1724"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1736"
msgid "Kiryu-san, sometimes, you let yourself get a little too distracted..."
msgstr ""

